# oracle: pair_style nb3b/screened with a hand-written 3-element file: K and theta0 symmetric in (i j k)/(i k j), per-element leg rho and cutoff differ, unused (i j k) rho/cutoff; random 50-atom box, NVE 30 steps
# oracle-inputs: w38nb3b_asym.nb3b.screened
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-9 abs=1e-12
units           metal
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic
region          box block 0 11 0 11 0 11
create_box      3 box
create_atoms    1 random 16 2024 box overlap 1.6 maxtry 200
create_atoms    2 random 18 3131 box overlap 1.6 maxtry 200
create_atoms    3 random 16 5557 box overlap 1.6 maxtry 200
mass            * 28.0
pair_style      nb3b/screened
pair_coeff      * * w38nb3b_asym.nb3b.screened P O Si
timestep        0.0005
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step temp pe etotal press pxx pyy pzz pxy pxz pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          10
run             30
